@guide A_Hillsbrad
@name Hillsbrad Foothills (Southshore)
@faction Alliance
@levels 28-31
@zone Hillsbrad Foothills
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Southshore quests: the coast, the Syndicate, the Crushridge ogres and the yetis. A short stop before Arathi.
@next A_Arathi

fp Southshore
bind Southshore
accept 9435 Missing Crystals
accept Down the Coast | Lieutenant Farren Orinelle, Southshore.
complete Down the Coast | Murlocs on the coast south of Southshore.
turnin Down the Coast
accept 559 Farren's Proof
accept Soothing Turtle Bisque | Chef Jessen.
complete Soothing Turtle Bisque | Snapjaws along the coast.
complete 559 Farren's Proof | Murloc heads from Torn Fin murlocs.
turnin Soothing Turtle Bisque
turnin 559 Farren's Proof
accept 560 Farren's Proof
accept Costly Menace | Darren Malvew.
complete Costly Menace | Hillsbrad farms; kill the Syndicate.
turnin Costly Menace
turnin 637 Sully Balloo's Letter | Turned in at Ironforge.
accept 683 Sara Balloo's Plea
complete 9435 Missing Crystals | Shipment of Rare Crystals: loot Unopened Crate.
accept 510 Foreboding Plans
accept 511 Encrypted Letter | Needs level 30. If you are lower, TBCGuide skips it and moves on.
turnin 683 Sara Balloo's Plea | Turned in at Ironforge.
accept 686 A King's Tribute
accept Syndicate Assassins | Magistrate Henry Maleb, town hall.
complete Syndicate Assassins | Syndicate camp north-east of Southshore (Durnholde area).
turnin Syndicate Assassins
turnin 510 Foreboding Plans
accept Crushridge Bounty | Marshal Redpath.
complete Crushridge Bounty | Crushridge ogres north of Southshore.
turnin Crushridge Bounty
turnin 560 Farren's Proof | Marshal Redpath.
accept 561 Farren's Proof
accept Hints of a New Plague? | Phin Odelic.
turnin 9435 Missing Crystals
turnin 561 Farren's Proof
accept Stormwind Ho!
complete Stormwind Ho! | Daggerspine naga further south.
turnin Stormwind Ho!
accept Reassignment
turnin 538 Southshore [optional]
turnin 511 Encrypted Letter
accept 514 Letter to Stormpike [optional] | Needs level 30. If you are lower, TBCGuide skips it and moves on.
accept Bartolo's Yeti Fur Cloak | Bartolo Ginsetti.
complete Bartolo's Yeti Fur Cloak | Yetis in the Alterac foothills cave.
turnin Bartolo's Yeti Fur Cloak
turnin 514 Letter to Stormpike [optional] | Turned in at Ironforge.
turnin 474 Defeat Nek'rosh [optional] | Turned in at Wetlands.
turnin 292 The Eye of Paleth | Turned in at Wetlands.
accept 293 Cleansing the Eye [optional]
accept 322 Blessed Arm [optional]
turnin 321 Lightforge Iron [optional]
turnin 686 A King's Tribute | Turned in at Ironforge.
complete Hints of a New Plague? | Forsaken courier on the road (patrols).
turnin Hints of a New Plague?
level 30
train | Ironforge via the Wetlands, or Stormwind by flight.
note Ride east past Durnholde into the Arathi Highlands; Refuge Pointe is the Alliance town.
